  "summary": "Calculate gross margin and net margin from revenue, cost of goods sold, and net income",
  "purpose": "Calculate gross margin and net margin from revenue, cost of goods sold, and net income. These are foundational profitability metrics that must be computed with precise formulas and disclosed assumptions.",
  "assignment_instructions": "You are calculating gross margin and net margin from financial data.\n\nGiven the financial inputs, compute the following with exact formulas:\n\n1. Gross Profit = Revenue - COGS\n2. Gross Margin = (Gross Profit / Revenue) * 100\n3. Net Margin = (Net Income / Revenue) * 100\n\nReturn a single JSON object with this exact structure:\n{\n  \"assignment_id\": \"fin_gross_net_margin_v1\",\n  \"agent_summary\": \"One sentence summary\",\n  \"inputs_used\": [\"revenue\", \"cogs\", \"net_income\"],\n  \"missing_inputs\": [\"any missing inputs\"],\n  \"claims\": [\n    {\"claim\": \"\", \"evidence_reference\": \"\", \"confidence\": \"provided | inferred | missing\"}\n  ],\n  \"calculations\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"gross_profit\",\n      \"formula\": \"Revenue - COGS\",\n      \"inputs\": {\"revenue\": 0, \"cogs\": 0},\n      \"result\": 0,\n      \"units\": \"currency\",\n      \"assumptions\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"gross_margin\",\n      \"formula\": \"(Gross Profit / Revenue) * 100\",\n      \"inputs\": {\"gross_profit\": 0, \"revenue\": 0},\n      \"result\": 0,\n      \"units\": \"percent\",\n      \"assumptions\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"net_margin\",\n      \"formula\": \"(Net Income / Revenue) * 100\",\n      \"inputs\": {\"net_income\": 0, \"revenue\": 0},\n      \"result\": 0,\n      \"units\": \"percent\",\n      \"assumptions\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"risks\": [\n    {\"risk\": \"\", \"severity\": \"low | medium | high\", \"evidence_reference\": \"\"}\n  ],\n  \"assumptions\": [],\n  \"open_questions\": [],\n  \"final_output\": \"PASS or FAIL\",\n  \"self_check\": {\n    \"all_required_sections_completed\": true,\n    \"all_numbers_have_sources\": true,\n    \"assumptions_labeled\": true,\n    \"missing_inputs_disclosed\": true\n  }\n}\n\nRules:\n- ALL input values used in calculations must be echoed in the inputs sub-object\n- result must be a numeric value (not a string)\n- Gross margin and net margin must be expressed as percentages\n- final_output is PASS if all three calculations are present with numeric results\n- final_output is FAIL if revenue is zero or negative (division by zero / invalid)\n- Show formulas exactly as specified\n\nReturn only the JSON. No markdown fences, no prose. Use only the provided evidence unless explicitly allowed to assume; label every assumption; if a required input is missing, say so; do not fabricate facts or cite evidence that was not provided.",
  "required_inputs": [
    "revenue",
    "cogs",
